[{"client_msg_id":"d673e7fb-916a-4b41-a155-5c99d2cccf9e","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"お、 nrpattern はドットリピート対応したんでしたっけ。パクろうかな","ts":"1618064481.182400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xt0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51b60625-a291-44b2-b3ba-a6f145cb6d36","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"パクるなら\n\u003chttps://github.com/zegervdv/nrpattern.nvim/blob/9801aa28d5792a328300ccecc287e0bfd3526b7d/plugin/nrpattern.vim\u003e","ts":"1618063850.181900","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: zegervdv/nrpattern.nvim","id":1,"title":"zegervdv/nrpattern.nvim","title_link":"https://github.com/zegervdv/nrpattern.nvim/blob/9801aa28d5792a328300ccecc287e0bfd3526b7d/plugin/nrpattern.vim","text":"Neovim plugin to expand incrementing/decrementing to more formats. - zegervdv/nrpattern.nvim","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/747627?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/zegervdv/nrpattern.nvim/blob/9801aa28d5792a328300ccecc287e0bfd3526b7d/plugin/nrpattern.vim","original_url":"https://github.com/zegervdv/nrpattern.nvim/blob/9801aa28d5792a328300ccecc287e0bfd3526b7d/plugin/nrpattern.vim"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hRuhd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65c5dd99-0f15-43de-8b69-b5b6fb1c6a9d","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"【質問】自前プラグインで実装した機能をドットリピートできるようにする手段ってどういうものがあるでしょうか？\n今の所プラグイン + ドットリピートに関する知識が\n• \u003chttps://github.com/tpope/vim-repeat/blob/master/autoload/repeat.vim\u003e がドットリピートを可能にするプラグイン\n• \u003chttps://github.com/machakann/vim-sandwich\u003e はドットリピート可能（自前実装？）\nぐらいしかなく。とりあえず repeat.vim のソースは暇なときに読んでみるつもりではいます。\ndial.nvim でもドットリピートしたいという Issue (\u003chttps://github.com/monaqa/dial.nvim/issues/6\u003e) が来てるんですが、どういう感じでやれば対応できそうか今の所見当もつかないのですよね。","ts":"1618063674.181100","thread_ts":"1618063674.181100","reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Xos"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01c6588c-82d6-4605-8f7f-42ca6ff13c8e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あと、Deniteは慣れればめちゃくちゃ肌に馴染みそう","ts":"1618048654.178200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L7N+V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a982647-6110-483d-8cff-4c4683f3cbed","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あとは、導入前のデモを作るときとか、自分は複数パターンのデモを作るのでそういう時は横断できるのが便利ですね","ts":"1618048626.177800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mIK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f3d47ab-29c1-4610-8bb1-0159162df247","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"サンプルコード写経するときとか、結構良い気がする","ts":"1618048579.176600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VL3J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f72e590-b687-4c04-a1a3-81de4303281a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"勉強するときに使えそうだな〜と今のところ思ってます。","ts":"1618048556.176100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b9pu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ABA04B76-7F42-4FDC-A492-0E5890DB07BC","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今だとプロジェクト単位はlsp辛いから別のvim起動したい気がしてる、上手く制御できるのかな","ts":"1618048509.175400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RuOgA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6d31c87-a564-4275-afa4-65285558c14a","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"複数のプロジェクト掛け持ちしてる状態だとありえるかな？","ts":"1618048452.174300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eVG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BA8461C4-5099-4A84-8E50-F9C0E2EF8D5E","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"人によっては使うのかな、VSCodeってプロジェクト単位でウィンドウ独立させるイメージあったので","ts":"1618039165.173600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ol1YG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96547f08-eeca-4163-b4cd-324e545a1067","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"VSCode で言う複数の workspace が並んでる状態と思えば、わかりやすそうかな。","ts":"1618039098.172400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5X1BC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74df42dd-405b-48f9-b103-71adcf90f652","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"トップレベルから指定した複数のディレクトリを展開状態にするのとそこまで変わらない気もする","ts":"1618038847.171700","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1618038854.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7hMLf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d90dbc5-e7c2-43ab-9105-bc6f05675b90","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"やったことないけどどれくらい便利なんだろうこれ","ts":"1618038627.171200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fhTx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5e417fd-9b42-4c56-bb95-ec03694e50a4","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"これがやりたくてずっとやり方探してたけど普通によく見たらパスを複数指定してるだけでした","ts":"1618038460.170500","thread_ts":"1618038460.170500","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KCF+S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07843d2c-ea4e-4175-af23-ca8514037f09","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/41495/45696476-ac9d0a80-bb9e-11e8-9ee2-120ac7d0f045.png\u003e","ts":"1618038436.169700","attachments":[{"fallback":"1920x1031px image","id":1,"image_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/41495/45696476-ac9d0a80-bb9e-11e8-9ee2-120ac7d0f045.png","blocks":null,"from_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/41495/45696476-ac9d0a80-bb9e-11e8-9ee2-120ac7d0f045.png","original_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/41495/45696476-ac9d0a80-bb9e-11e8-9ee2-120ac7d0f045.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+gYYb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9240adf7-a8bf-4cc2-b583-0dc89559cb5b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、lspとはちがうから、意味ちがうか","ts":"1618038436.169600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+=jd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6713d27e-d976-4db0-9949-b9a047ee928c","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"普通に解決できました！","ts":"1618038423.169200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u=Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bbffe81-558f-4cf0-8a23-2aa6c8a2591d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"モノレポのフロントエンドJS(foo,bar)とバックエンドJS(hoge,fuga)を同時管理できる認識だけど、どうなんだろうね","ts":"1618038411.168800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/WPL="}]},{"client_msg_id":"077067F1-60C8-44A7-AEFA-0B2447369A40","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"マルチルートって何ができるんですか？\nトップレベルに複数のディレクトリを置ける？","ts":"1618037780.168000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h7x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54182482-5579-4819-8a77-b5603e8ab335","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"質問だったのでこちらに再掲します。今、defx.nvimのマルチルート機能が気になって設定しようとしているのですが、全く設定方法がわかりません。どなたか設定してらっしゃる方はいませんか？\nいまは `call defx#custom#source()` が怪しいなというぐらいの推測しかできていません。","ts":"1618036763.166600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wle8h"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01TW4QG718","text":"\u003c@U01TW4QG718\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1618006611.164500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U01U78LQHJ5","text":"\u003c@U01U78LQHJ5\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1617983660.164300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"c794e97e-e2be-484e-b3e5-40fd65e388dc","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"vim-repeat を使うのが一番簡単だと思います。もし茨の道をゆくなら機能をオペレータとして実装して、適当なモーションと合わせてマッピングをつくればリピート可能になります。","ts":"1618065796.182900","thread_ts":"1618063674.181100","parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sasu","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MxVxX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"223ae0b8-39d6-412c-bf12-3271cb945f3c","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ありがとうございます。\n\u0026gt; もし茨の道をゆくなら機能をオペレータとして実装して、適当なモーションと合わせてマッピングをつくればリピート可能になります。\nなるほど、そういう方法で実装されていたんですね…","ts":"1618066119.183100","thread_ts":"1618063674.181100","parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gdUK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e70aaa84-7e49-4396-863d-988e5e9fd623","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"組み込みの `x` が\n```nnoremap x dl```\nで理解できるような感じですね。","ts":"1618066339.183300","thread_ts":"1618063674.181100","parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/69"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5af7fd9-bac6-4f5a-8345-0f6d54dbe9dd","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"はい","ts":"1618040832.173700","thread_ts":"1618038460.170500","parent_user_id":"U01AQ5BFNLX","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L2ga0"}]}]
